<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt details H1 results.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt details H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income from operations 143		 vs 102</p>
<p>   Minority interests	 28		  vs 25</p>
<p>   Attributable to Elekt.   115		 vs 77</p>
<p>   In Sfrs per share	  13.30	     vs 9.00</p>
<p> Net sales			3,714	     vs 3,406</p>
<p>   Sales industry segment   2,799	     vs 2,484</p>
<p>   Sales energy segment     915		 vs 922</p>
<p> Order Intake		   3,916	     vs 3,699</p>
<p>   Orders industry segment  3,001	     vs 2,777</p>
<p>   Orders energy segment    915		 vs 922</p>
<p> Cash flow			448		 vs 367</p>
<p> Net operating income	 305		 vs 257</p>
<p>* Net includes acquisitions/disposals and impact of currency translation</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are for Elektrowatt Group. Group is to be split into industry and energy segment prior to sale of most of 44.9 percent stake held by Credit Suisse group.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
